<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Getting started on Spine Event Engine</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/</link><description>Recent content in Getting started on Spine Event Engine</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><atom:link href="https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Adding to build</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/adding-to-build/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/adding-to-build/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="adding-validation-to-a-gradle-build" data-title&gt;
Adding Validation to a Gradle build&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2 id="adding-spine-specific-gradle-plugin-repositories" data-title&gt;
Adding Spine-specific Gradle plugin repositories&lt;span class="nowrap-icon"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class="anchor-icon" href=#adding-spine-specific-gradle-plugin-repositories
 aria-label="Copy heading anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;embed-code 
file="$examples/settings.gradle.kts" 
start="pluginManagement {" 
end="^}"&gt;
&lt;/embed-code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-kotlin" data-lang="kotlin"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pluginManagement&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;repositories&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;mavenLocal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;gradlePluginPortal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;maven&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://europe-maven.pkg.dev/spine-event-engine/snapshots&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;maven&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://europe-maven.pkg.dev/spine-event-engine/releases&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The repositories at &lt;a href="https://europe-maven.pkg.dev"
 
 
 class="external-link"
 target="_blank"
 rel="noopener nofollow"
 &gt;https://europe-maven.pkg.dev&lt;/a&gt; are needed to obtain versions of
Spine tools and libraries that are not yet published to the Gradle Plugin Portal or Maven Central.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="optional-adding-spine-specific-maven-repositories" data-title&gt;
Optional: adding Spine-specific Maven repositories&lt;span class="nowrap-icon"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class="anchor-icon" href=#optional-adding-spine-specific-maven-repositories
 aria-label="Copy heading anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Similar to the plugin repositories, a project using Validation may need artifacts that
are not yet published to Maven Central. Our Gradle plugins take care of this by adding the
necessary repositories to the project when applied. Normally, you don&amp;rsquo;t need to add
repositories manually when using the plugins.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Building project</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/build-project/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/build-project/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="build-your-project" data-title&gt;
Build your project&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After you added Validation to the build and declared constraints in your Protobuf model,
run your Gradle build as usual.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For macOS and Linux:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./gradlew clean build
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;For Windows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-powershell" data-lang="powershell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;gradlew&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="py"&gt;bat&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;clean&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;build&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Validation Gradle plugin integrates with Spine Compiler, scans your model, and injects
validation checks into the generated JVM code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The generated sources will appear in the &lt;code&gt;generated&lt;/code&gt; directory next to the &lt;code&gt;src&lt;/code&gt; directory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;clean&lt;/code&gt; task is optional and is relevant when Protobuf code changes.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Defining constraints</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/first-model/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/first-model/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="define-constraints-in-proto-files" data-title&gt;
Define constraints in &lt;code&gt;.proto&lt;/code&gt; files&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This guide shows how to import Spine Validation options and declare constraints
in your Protobuf model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The validation options come from &lt;code&gt;spine/options.proto&lt;/code&gt; and include constraints like
&lt;code&gt;(required)&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;(min)&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;(max)&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;(pattern)&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;(distinct)&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;(validate)&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="import-options-and-declare-constraints" data-title&gt;
Import options and declare constraints&lt;span class="nowrap-icon"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class="anchor-icon" href=#import-options-and-declare-constraints
 aria-label="Copy heading anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create a &lt;code&gt;.proto&lt;/code&gt; file and import &lt;code&gt;spine/options.proto&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;embed-code 
file="$examples/first-model/src/main/proto/spine/validation/docs/first_model/bank_card.proto" 
start="syntax" 
end="^}"&gt;
&lt;/embed-code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-protobuf" data-lang="protobuf"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;syntax&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;proto3&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;package&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;spine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;validation.docs.first_model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;spine/options.proto&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;option&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;type_url_prefix&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;type.spine.io&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;option&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;java_package&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;io.spine.validation.docs.firstmodel&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;option&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;java_multiple_files&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Provides bank card information with validation rules.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;//
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// The digits of the card are simplified for the sake of the example.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;//
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;message&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;BankCard&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// The digits of the card number.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;//
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Must be present and match a 16-digit card number formatted as four
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// groups of four digits separated by spaces (for example, &amp;#34;1234 5678 1234 5678&amp;#34;).
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;//
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;digits&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pattern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;regex&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;^\\d{4}(?: \\d{4}){3}&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;];&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// The name of the card owner.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;//
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Must be present, contain at least 4 characters, start with a Latin letter,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// and have exactly one space between words.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;//
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;owner&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pattern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;regex&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;^(?=.{4,})[A-Z][A-Za-z]*(?: [A-Za-z]+)+$&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;];&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// All tags must be unique. Tags are optional.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;repeated&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;tags&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;distinct&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;];&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Notes on the options used:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Using the generated code</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/generated-code/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/generated-code/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="using-the-generated-code" data-title&gt;
Using the generated code&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This guide shows how the generated JVM API enforces constraints at runtime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Validation runs automatically when a message is created.
It is also possible to validate an existing instance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="validation-on-creation" data-title&gt;
Validation on creation&lt;span class="nowrap-icon"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class="anchor-icon" href=#validation-on-creation
 aria-label="Copy heading anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When a message violates declared constraints, &lt;code&gt;build()&lt;/code&gt; throws &lt;code&gt;ValidationException&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;














&lt;div class="code-block code-tabs "
 &gt;
 &lt;div class="code-block-header tabs "&gt;
 &lt;div class="indicator"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 
 &lt;div class="tab" lang="kotlin"&gt;Kotlin&lt;/div&gt;
 
 
 &lt;div class="tab" lang="java"&gt;Java&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;/div&gt;
 




&lt;div class="code-wrapper code-tab-content" lang="kotlin"&gt;
 
 
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;embed-code 
file="$examples/first-model/src/test/kotlin/io/spine/validation/docs/firstmodel/BankCardKtTest.kt" 
fragment="invalid-digits"&gt;
&lt;/embed-code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-kotlin" data-lang="kotlin"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;shouldThrow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;ValidationException&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Kotlin proto DSL delegates to a Java builder.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;bankCard&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;digits&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;invalid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;owner&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;ALEX SMITH&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
&lt;/div&gt;




&lt;div class="code-wrapper code-tab-content" lang="java"&gt;
 
 
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;embed-code 
file="$examples/first-model/src/test/java/io/spine/validation/docs/firstmodel/BankCardTest.java" 
fragment="invalid-digits"&gt;
&lt;/embed-code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>